                    "widgetType": "html",
                    "settings": {
                        "html": "<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Lato:wght@300;400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<div class=\"brand-story-grid\">\n  <div class=\"brand-story-content\">\n    <h2 class=\"brand-story-heading\">Our Story</h2>\n    <div class=\"brand-story-text\">\n      <p>Stillness was born from a simple realization: that in our hyper-connected world, silence is the ultimate luxury.</p>\n      <p>Founded in 2022 by Elena Corves, Stillness began as a small boutique float studio dedicated to the art of doing nothing. Elena's own experience with chronic stress led her to discover the profound healing power of sensory deprivation.</p>\n      <p>What started as a single float tank has evolved into a holistic sanctuary where thousands have rediscovered the spaciousness of their own minds.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"brand-story-image\">\n    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544367563-12123d896889?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Serene spa environment\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.brand-story-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 6rem;\n  align-items: center;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.brand-story-heading {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n  font-size: 56px !important;\n  line-height: 1.1 !important;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em !important;\n  color: #1D3152 !important;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem !important;\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n}\n\n.brand-story-text p {\n  font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n  font-weight: 300 !important;\n  font-size: 18px !important;\n  line-height: 1.8 !important;\n  color: rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.75) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;\n}\n\n.brand-story-text p:last-child {\n  margin-bottom: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.brand-story-image {\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n}\n\n.brand-story-image img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  filter: grayscale(100%);\n  transition: all 1s ease;\n}\n\n.brand-story-grid:hover .brand-story-image img {\n  filter: grayscale(0%);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .brand-story-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    gap: 3rem;\n  }\n  .brand-story-heading {\n    font-size: 40px !important;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
                    }
                }
